With this change:

- The default pass (whose `passName === 'defaultPass'`) will never hang waiting for FCP.
- The perf pass (or any other pass with `recordTrace === true` but a different `passName`) will still wait for FCP as intended.
- Pages that never fire FCP will fall back to the normal load/idle strategy (and hit the shorter, “maxWaitForLoad” timeout) rather than the 60 s protocol timeout.
